     card's edge and from the strip's hairline, as they sit 16px from the card's sides, so a strip is 60px plus its hairline.
     Every strip's row is 28px, whether it holds a control or only words, so a strip never changes height as its controls
     come and go */
  --dm-strip-y:16px;
}
