   say it (the time keeps its tooltip), the tree draws closer, and the details give the start its own line. The head's mark
   keeps its 32px tile, so each span's mark stays centred under it, with the words 8px after it; the same columns
   run down the card, and the time axis is a little shorter */
@container (max-width:330px){
  .trv-ax,.trv-r{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 60px 44px}.trv-tk,.trv-n .tag{display:none}.trv-g{display:none}.trv-kv{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
